id: SC-SEC-010
title: Dependency confusion attack surface (Birsan 2021)
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: .npmrc pip.conf pyproject.toml
  exclude_paths: test/ .git/ node_modules/
patterns:
  - regex: registry\s*=\s*https://registry\.npmjs\.org
    message: "Public registry as primary — if you use private packages, configure scoped registries to prevent dependency confusion"
  - regex: extra-index-url
    message: "extra-index-url without --index-url restriction — pip may fetch from public PyPI instead of private registry"
fix: Scope private packages with @org/pkg and configure scoped registries in .npmrc. For pip, pin index-url to private registry.